{"ex-407-1":{"id":"ex-407-1","chapter":"407","number":1,"title":"磁鐵通過線圈","question":"<p>如圖所示，一支磁棒穿過線圈。試在下列各情況中繪畫出感生電流 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的方向，據此，判斷電阻器的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端還是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端有較高的電勢，並解釋原因。</p><p>(a) 磁棒移近線圈</p><p>(b) 磁棒在線圈正中間</p><p>(c) 磁棒移離線圈</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/d6624488b5495463f2a2e8ea.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:540.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端有較高的電勢。</p><p>(b)</p><p>沒有產生感生電流。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端有相同的電勢。</p><p>(c)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端有較高的電勢。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/46db85fbbac1d0ad1acd13b1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:420.1px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/731de95316178344986f00f8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:321.2px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/de84b0004ac71bdeef661b5a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:411.7px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在外電路中，電流由電勢較高的位置流向電勢較低的位置。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":7,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,100.99698339843758,565.2833009033203,364.24525451660156],"text":"例 題 1 磁鐵通過線圈\r\n如圖所示，一支磁棒穿過線圈。試在下列各情況中繪畫出感生電流 I\r\n的方向，據此，判斷電阻器的 X 端還是 Y 端有較高的電勢，並解釋原\r\n因。\r\n(a) 磁棒移近線圈\r\n(b) 磁棒在線圈正中間\r\n(c) 磁棒移離線圈\r\nN S N S N S\r\nP\r\nX Y\r\nP Q\r\nX Y\r\nP Q\r\nX Y\r\nQ\r\n移近線圈 在線圈正中間 移離線圈\r\n磁棒\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,364.24525451660156,565.2833009033203,746.7819833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) \r\nN S\r\nP\r\nX Y\r\nQ\r\nI\r\n磁棒\r\n② 運用右手握拳定則\r\n 找出 I 的方向\r\n①\r\nQ\r\n根據楞次定律，\r\n 是北極\r\nX 端有較高的電勢。\r\n(b) \r\nN S\r\nP Q\r\nX Y\r\n在兩端的感生電動勢互相抵消\r\n沒有產生感生電流。X 端和 Y 端有相同的電勢。\r\n(c) \r\nN S\r\nP\r\nX Y\r\nQ\r\nI\r\n② 運用右手握拳定則\r\n 找出 I 的方向\r\n① 根據楞次定律，\r\n 是北極 P\r\nY 端有較高的電勢。\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"tips","box":[40,96.99698339843758,184.2833009033203,746.7819833984375],"text":"楞次是俄羅斯物理學\r\n家，以楞次定律聞名於\r\n世。他還獨自發現了焦\r\n耳定律 (P = I 2\r\nR)。\r\n手搖電筒\r\n這個電筒不需要更換電\r\n池。搖動電筒時，電筒\r\n中的磁鐵會反覆進出線\r\n圈，從而感生出電流為\r\n電池充電。\r\n影片\r\n知多一點\r\n提提你\r\n在外電路，電流從電勢較\r\n高的位置流向電勢較低的\r\n位置。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-2":{"id":"ex-407-2","chapter":"407","number":2,"title":"線圈進入勻強磁場","question":"<p>矩形金屬線圈 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 正進入勻強磁場，磁場指入頁面。</p><p>(a) 試解釋線圈中感生電流的方向。</p><p>(b) 試解釋當整個線圈處於磁場內，感生電流會否產生。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dbc6c32e572eb49889cc3e57.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:216.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 線圈移動時，所包圍的磁力線會愈來愈多，而這些磁力線都指入頁面。</p><p>根據楞次定律，為了抗衡這個變化，感生電流會產生指出頁面的磁力線。</p><p>根據右手握拳定則，感生電流以逆時針方向流動。</p><p>(b) 線圈中沒有感生出電流，因為線圈包圍的磁力線數量保持不變。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[183.7833009033203,360.1479833984375,560.7833009033203,593.8820648193359],"text":"例 題 2 線圈進入勻強磁場\r\n矩形金屬線圈 PQRS 正進入勻強磁場，磁場指入頁面。\r\nS\r\nP\r\nR\r\nQ \r\n勻強磁場\r\n(a) 試解釋線圈中感生電流的方向。\r\n(b) 試解釋當整個線圈處於磁場內，感生電流會否產生。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[183.7833009033203,593.8820648193359,560.7833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 線圈移動時，所包圍的磁力線會愈來愈多，而這些磁力線都指入\r\n頁面。\r\n根據楞次定律，為了抗衡這個變化，感生電流會產生指出頁面的\r\n磁力線。\r\n根據右手握拳定則，感生電流以逆時針方向流動。\r\n(b) 線圈中沒有感生出電流，因為線圈包圍的磁力線數量保持不變。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-3":{"id":"ex-407-3","chapter":"407","number":3,"title":"導體切割磁場","question":"<p>直導體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQ</annotation></semantics></math></span> 連接到電阻器，如圖所示在指入頁面的勻強磁場中向右移動。</p><p>(a) 指出感生電流通過導體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQ</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的方向。</p><p>(b) 導體的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端還是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端有較高的電勢？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/8347dad662e78c4c9cf916d0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:150.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>根據弗萊明右手定則，</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/6ee3af4be4e1158befe7c599.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:187.1px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,293.6432342529297],"text":"例 題 3 導體切割磁場\r\n直導體 PQ 連接到電阻器，如圖所示在指入頁面的勻強磁場中向右\r\n移動。\r\nP\r\nv\r\nQ\r\nB\r\n(a) 指出感生電流通過導體 PQ 的方向。\r\n(b) 導體的 P 端還是 Q 端有較高的電勢？\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,293.6432342529297,560.2833009033203,376.1799833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 從 Q 流向 P\r\n(b) P 端\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,376.1799833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n根據弗林明的右手定則，\r\nI 指向電勢較高\r\n的一端\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-4":{"id":"ex-407-4","chapter":"407","number":4,"title":"線圈與直導線","question":"<p>如圖所示，線圈 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 旁有一條長直導線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>下列哪項可使 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 產生順時針方向的感生電流？</p><p>(1) 穩定電流從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(2) 電流從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span>，並持續減小。</p><p>(3) 電流從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>，並持續增加。</p><p>A 只有 (1) B 只有 (2) C 只有 (2) 和 (3) D (1)、(2) 和 (3)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/875e0af7b2075d47e862c8eb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:190.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>電流穩定時，通過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的磁場不會改變，因此沒有感生電流。</p><p>∴ (1) 不正確。</p><p>電流從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 時，根據右手握拳定則，通過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的磁場指入頁面。</p><p>電流減小時，磁場也會減小。根據楞次定律，感生電流會產生指入頁面的磁場以抗衡變化。再次根據右手握拳定則，感生電流會以順時針方向流動。</p><p>∴ (2) 正確。</p><p>同樣，電流從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 流向 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 時，通過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的磁場指出頁面。當電流增加，感生電流會產生指入頁面的磁場以抗衡變化。</p><p>∴ (3) 正確。</p><p>∴ 答案是 C。 <sup>複習7</sup> <sup>Q10</sup> <sup>(p.311)</sup></p><p>溫習 7 第 10 題（第 311 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":11,"kind":"question","box":[188.4833009033203,296.58998339843754,565.4833009033202,508.9059600830078],"text":"例 題 4 線圈與直導線\r\n如圖所示，線圈 PQRS 旁有一條長直導線 XY。\r\n下列哪項可使 PQRS 產生順時針方向的感\r\n生電流？\r\n(1) 穩定電流從 Y 流向 X。\r\n(2) 電流從 X 流向 Y，並持續減小。\r\n(3) 電流從 Y 流向 X，並持續增加。\r\nA 只有 (1) B 只有 (2)\r\nC 只有 (2) 和 (3) D (1)、(2) 和 (3)\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[188.4833009033203,508.9059600830078,565.4833009033202,747.4429833984375],"text":"題解\r\n電流穩定時，通過 PQRS 的磁場不會改變，因此沒有感生電流。\r\n∴ (1) 不正確。\r\n電流從 X 流向 Y 時，根據右手握拳定則，通過 PQRS 的磁場指入頁面。\r\n電流減小時，磁場也會減小。根據楞次定律，感生電流會產生指入頁面\r\n的磁場以抗衡變化。再次根據右手握拳定則，感生電流會以順時針方向\r\n流動。\r\n∴ (2) 正確。\r\n同樣，電流從 Y 流向 X 時，通過 PQRS 的磁場指出頁面。當電流增\r\n加，感生電流會產生指入頁面的磁場以抗衡變化。\r\n∴ (3) 正確。\r\n∴ 答案是 C。\r\n 香港中學文憑2014年卷一甲部 Q27\r\n複習 7 Q10 (p.311)\r\nX\r\nP Q\r\nS R\r\nY\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-5":{"id":"ex-407-5","chapter":"407","number":5,"title":"磁棒下墜穿過線圈","question":"<p>北極向下的磁棒下墜並穿過線圈（圖 a）。電壓感應器記錄線圈中的感生電動勢 ε，圖 b 顯示 ε 怎樣隨時間變化。</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 下墜過程中 ε 的正負值會改變，試說明原因。</p><p>(b) 解釋為甚麼負峯值會比正峯值大。</p><p>(c) 在下列情況，線圖會有甚麼改變？</p><p>(i) 磁棒的兩極對調</p><p>(ii) 改用匝數較多的線圈</p><p>(d) 如果線圈連接到 1 Ω 電阻器而不是電壓感應器，磁棒會下墜得較快還是較慢？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/da3c9c46ca94b01816066f2e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:566.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據楞次定律，磁棒靠近線圈上端時，感生電動勢傾向使上端變成北極，以抗衡正在移近的磁棒北極。磁棒離開線圈下端時，感生電動勢傾向使下端變成北極，以吸引正在離開的磁棒南極。因此 ε 的正負值會改變。</p><p>(b) 磁棒受重力作用而加快下墜，所以離開線圈時速率會較高，通過線圈的磁通量變化率也會較高，因此，ε 的量值較大。</p><p>(c) (i) 線圖的形狀會上下倒轉。</p><p>(ii) 正峯值和負峯值都會增大。</p><p>(d) 由於電路的電阻會降低，因此感生電流會增加。磁棒會受到較大的磁力抗衡，所以會下墜得較慢。</p><p>複習7 Q4 (p.310)</p><p>溫習 7 第 4 題（第 310 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":12,"kind":"question","box":[49.83430090332031,56.333983398437454,560.4833009033204,513.3808441162109],"text":"例 題 5 磁棒下墜穿過線圈\r\n北極向下的磁棒下墜並穿過線圈（圖 a）。電壓感應器記錄線圈中的感生電動勢 ε，圖 b 顯示 ε 怎\r\n樣隨時間變化。\r\n圖 b\r\n線圈\r\n磁棒\r\n軟墊\r\n膠管\r\n電壓感\r\n應器\r\n圖 a\r\n時間 / s\r\n電動勢 / V\r\n(a) 下墜過程中 ε 的正負值會改變，試說明原因。\r\n(b) 解釋為甚麼負峯值會比正峯值大。\r\n(c) 在下列情況，線圖會有甚麼改變？\r\n (i) 磁棒的兩極對調\r\n (ii) 改用匝數較多的線圈\r\n(d) 如果線圈連接到 1 Ω 電阻器而不是電壓感應器，磁棒會下墜得較快還是較慢？\r\n"},{"page":12,"kind":"answer","box":[49.83430090332031,513.3808441162109,560.4833009033204,751.4539833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據楞次定律，磁棒靠近線圈上端時，感生電動勢傾向使上端變成北極，以抗衡正在移近的\r\n磁棒北極。磁棒離開線圈下端時，感生電動勢傾向使下端變成北極，以吸引正在離開的磁棒\r\n南極。因此 ε 的正負值會改變。\r\n(b) 磁棒受重力作用而加快下墜，所以離開線圈時速率會較高，通過線圈的磁通量變化率也會較\r\n高，因此，ε 的量值較大。\r\n(c) (i) 線圖的形狀會上下倒轉。\r\n (ii) 正峯值和負峯值都會增大。\r\n(d) 由於電路的電阻會降低，因此感生電流會增加。磁棒會受到較大的磁力抗衡，所以會下墜得\r\n較慢。\r\n複習 7 Q4 (p.310)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-6":{"id":"ex-407-6","chapter":"407","number":6,"title":"交流發電機的電流","question":"<p>下圖顯示一部簡單交流發電機所產生的電流怎樣隨時間改變。</p><p>(a) 在甚麼時候線圈的平面會 (i) 平行於磁場；(ii) 垂直於磁場？各舉一個例子。</p><p>(b) 電流的頻率是多少？</p><p>(c) 現將線圈的轉速提升至原來的兩倍。草繪電流隨時間變化的關係線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/45ae3390f1e438cf1a0f39a5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:285.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) 0.01 s (or 0.03 s, 0.05 s, etc.)</p><p>(ii) 0 (or 0.02 s, 0.04 s, etc.)</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 25 Hz</p><p>(c)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/716aa3908bd563c5df0da4d3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:285.0px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>當線圈以兩倍速率轉動時，f 加倍，T 減半。由於線圈切割磁場線的速率增加，所產生的最大電流也增加。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,565.2833009033203,333.8058624267578],"text":"例 題 6 交流發電機的電流\r\n下圖顯示一部簡單交流發電機所產生的電流怎樣隨時間改變。\r\n0.02 0.04 0.06\r\n0\r\n電流 / A\r\n時間 / s\r\n(a) 在甚麼時候線圈的平面會 (i) 平行於磁場；(ii) 垂直於磁場？各舉\r\n一個例子。\r\n(b) 電流的頻率是多少？\r\n(c) 現將線圈的轉速提升至原來的兩倍。草繪電流隨時間變化的關係\r\n線圖。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,333.8058624267578,565.2833009033203,552.4459833984374],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) 0.01 s（或 0.03 s、0.05 s 等時刻）\r\n (ii) 0（或 0.02 s、0.04 s 等時刻）\r\n(b) f = 1\r\nT = 1\r\n0.04 = 25 Hz\r\n(c) \r\n0.02 0.04 0.06\r\n0\r\n電流 / A\r\n時間 / s\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,184.2833009033203,552.4459833984374],"text":"提提你\r\n線圈轉速提升至原來的兩\r\n倍時，f 會增加至原來的兩\r\n倍，T 會減半。\r\n由於線圈以較高切割率切割\r\n磁力線，產生的最大電流會\r\n增加。\r\n實用發電機\r\n實用發電機中，線圈通\r\n常都是固定的，而轉動\r\n的是磁鐵。你知道為甚\r\n麼嗎？\r\np.320\r\n知多一點\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-7":{"id":"ex-407-7","chapter":"407","number":7,"title":"計算磁通匝鏈數","question":"<p>面積為 4 cm<sup>2</sup> 的 10 匝線圈處於磁通量密度為 2 × 10<sup>–3</sup> T 的勻強磁場中。求以下情況中通過線圈的磁通匝鏈數：</p><p>(a) 線圈的法線與磁場互相平行（圖 a）</p><p>(b) 線圈的法線與磁場成 30°角（圖 b）</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dd6a50ea911d682272707fdd.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:304.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 磁通匝鏈數</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span>Φ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span>(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BA</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = (10)(2 × 10<sup>–3</sup>)(4 × 10<sup>–4</sup>) = 8 × 10<sup>–6</sup> Wb</p><p>(b) 磁通匝鏈數</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NBA</annotation></semantics></math></span> cos θ = (8 × 10<sup>–6</sup>) cos 30° = 6.93 × 10<sup>–6</sup> Wb</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":32,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.2833009033203,287.0580291748047],"text":"例 題 7 計算磁通匝鏈數\r\n面積為 4 cm2 的 10 匝線圈處於磁通量密度為 2 × 10–3 T 的勻強磁場\r\n中。求以下情況中通過線圈的磁通匝鏈數：\r\n(a) 線圈的法線與磁場互相平行（圖 a）\r\n(b) 線圈的法線與磁場成 30°角（圖 b）\r\nB\r\n線圈\r\n圖 a\r\n30°\r\nB\r\n線圈\r\n圖 b\r\n"},{"page":32,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,287.0580291748047,560.2833009033203,413.5949833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 磁通匝鏈數\r\n = NΦ = N(BA) = (10)(2 × 10–3)(4 × 10–4) = 8 × 10–6 Wb\r\n(b) 磁通匝鏈數\r\n = NBA cos θ = (8 × 10–6) cos 30° = 6.93 × 10–6 Wb\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-8":{"id":"ex-407-8","chapter":"407","number":8,"title":"變化的磁場和轉動的線圈","question":"<p>面積為 0.01 m<sup>2</sup> 的 10 匝方形線圈置於 4 mT 的勻強磁場內，磁場指入頁面（圖 a）。求下列情況中，線圈中感生電動勢的平均值。</p><p>(a) 磁場在 0.2 s 內降至零圖 a</p><p>(b) 磁場降至零，然後方向反轉，變為指出頁面的4 mT 磁場，整個過程歷時 0.2 s（圖 b）</p><p>圖 b</p><p>(c) 線圈在 0.5 s 內轉動 180（° 圖 c）</p><p>圖 c</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e8f6778ae2cab268ec9bb5ca.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:90.5px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dc0a70ad454c97710bba616f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:245.8px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/0139c06ac53cac9e74dac1a2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:279.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) ε = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = (10)(0.01)(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 2 × 10<sup>–3</sup> V</p><p>(b) ΔΦ = Δ(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>) = (4 × 10<sup>–3</sup>)(0.01) – [–(4 × 10<sup>–3</sup>)(0.01)] = 8 × 10<sup>–5</sup> Wb</p><p>ε = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = (10)(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 4 × 10<sup>–3</sup> V</p><p>(c) ΔΦ = 8 × 10<sup>–5</sup> Wb</p><p>ε = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = (10)(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>) = 1.6 × 10<sup>–3</sup> V</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>計算 ε 的大小時，使用 ΔB 的大小。</p><p>提示</p><p>當 B 反向時，它沿相反方向穿過線圈，因此 Φ 由 BA 變為 –BA。</p><p>提示</p><p>線圈轉動 180° 後，B 沿相反方向穿過線圈，因此 ΔΦ 與 (b) 相同。</p>","think":"<p>如果 (c) 中的線圈在 0.25 s 內轉動 90°，ε 的平均值是多少？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>每匝的磁通量由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 變為零。平均感生電動勢的大小為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>ε</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>|</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>|</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":34,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,146.33398339843745,560.2833009033203,485.99794006347656],"text":"例 題 8 變化的磁場和轉動的線圈\r\n面積為 0.01 m2 的 10 匝方形線圈置於 4 mT 的勻強磁\r\n場內，磁場指入頁面（圖 a）。求下列情況中，線圈中\r\n感生電動勢的平均值。\r\n(a) 磁場在 0.2 s 內降至零\r\n(b) 磁場降至零，然後方向反轉，變為指出頁面的\r\n4 mT 磁場，整個過程歷時 0.2 s（圖 b）\r\n4 mT\r\nW\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY\r\n4 mT\r\nW\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY\r\n圖 b\r\n(c) 線圈在 0.5 s 內轉動 180（圖° c）\r\n4 mT\r\nW\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY\r\n4 mT\r\nX\r\nW\r\nY\r\nZ\r\n圖 c\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,485.99794006347656,560.2833009033203,719.2079833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) ε = Δ(NΦ)\r\nΔt = Δ(NBA)\r\nΔt = NA ×\r\nΔB\r\nΔt\r\n = (10)(0.01)• 4 × 10–3 − 0\r\n0.2 •\r\n= 2 × 10–3 V\r\n(b) ΔΦ = Δ(BA) = (4 × 10–3)(0.01) – [–(4 × 10–3)(0.01)] = 8 × 10–5 Wb\r\nε = N ΔΦ\r\nΔt\r\n = (10)•\r\n8 × 10–5\r\n0.2 •\r\n = 4 × 10–3 V\r\n(c) ΔΦ = 8 × 10–5 Wb\r\nε = N ΔΦ\r\nΔt\r\n = (10)•\r\n8 × 10–5\r\n0.5 •\r\n = 1.6 × 10–3 V\r\n 香港中學文憑考試 2019 年卷一乙部 Q9(b)\r\n想一想\r\n4 mT\r\nW\r\nX\r\nZ\r\nY\r\n圖 a\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"tips","box":[40,142.33398339843745,179.2833009033203,719.2079833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n利用 ΔB 的量值來計算 ε 的\r\n量值。\r\n提提你\r\n當 B 的 方 向 反 轉，B 會以\r\n相反方向通過線圈，所以\r\nΦ 從 BA 變為 –BA。\r\n提提你\r\n線圈轉動180° 後，B 會以\r\n相反方向通過線圈，所以\r\nΔΦ 與 (b) 相同。\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"answer","box":[180.28300480332032,682.3540801984375,563.2830048033203,755.4010801984375],"text":"想一想\r\n(c) 的線圈在 0.25 s 內轉動 90°時，ε 的平均值是多少？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-407-9":{"id":"ex-407-9","chapter":"407","number":9,"title":"磁通量的切割率","question":"<p>導電線圈 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PQRS</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以 0.04 m s<sup>–1</sup> 的恆速率移動，並進入 2 mT 的勻強磁場中。線圈進入磁場時，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QR</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩端的感生電動勢是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5f70213f06ef3a3e6f5f4adf.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:226.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>在時距 Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 內，磁場內線圈面積的變化為：</p><p>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.1 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span>Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.1(0.04)Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.004Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>ε = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{ΔΦ}{Δt}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Δ(BA)}{Δt}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{ΔA}{Δt}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (2 × 10<sup>–3</sup>) × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.004</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.004Δt}{Δt}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 8 × 10<sup>–6</sup> V</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/d98cfe78b51bce43c50dcf0f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:230.0px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>1 感生電流的方向如何？</p><p>2 當線圈完全進入磁場時，ε 是多少？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>1 逆時針，R → Q → P → S → R。線圈進入磁場時，指向紙內的磁通量增加。根據楞次定律，感生電流產生指向紙外的磁場，以反抗該增加。</p><p>2 整個線圈的淨感生電動勢為零：位於均勻磁場內的面積不變，因此磁通量也不變，沒有感生電流。由於原題提及 QR，需作區分：移動邊 QR 本身的運動電動勢仍為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>B</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，但在整個電路中，PS 產生大小相等、方向相反的貢獻。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_407_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"8f5365acaeafa2220cfe79021586a8d84d719e6baa479995653aeea5cb35fca3","segments":[{"page":35,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,205.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 9 磁通量的切割率\r\n導電線圈 PQRS 以 0.04 m s–1 的恆\r\n速率移動，並進入 2 mT 的勻強磁場\r\n中。線圈進入磁場時，QR 兩端的感生\r\n電動勢是多少？\r\n"},{"page":35,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,205.6500701904297,565.2833009033203,410.9599833984375],"text":"題解\r\n0.1 m\r\n∆s = v∆t\r\n在 ∆t 內包圍面積的變化\r\n在時距 Δt 內，磁場內線圈面積的變化為：\r\nΔA = 0.1 × vΔt = 0.1(0.04)Δt = 0.004Δt\r\nε = ΔΦ\r\nΔt\r\n = Δ(BA)\r\nΔt = B ×\r\nΔA\r\nΔt\r\n = (2 × 10–3) ×\r\n0.004Δt\r\nΔt\r\n = 8 × 10–6 V\r\nB = 2 m T\r\n0.1 m\r\n0.16 m\r\nv = 0.04 m s–1\r\nR\r\nP Q\r\nS\r\n"},{"page":35,"kind":"answer","box":[185.28300480332032,399.6966857984375,568.2830048033203,497.5746857984375],"text":"想一想\r\n1 感生電流指向哪個方向？\r\n2 當整個線圈在磁場內，ε 是多少？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}